  "notes": [
    "The supplied file is an XLSX stored in Google Drive, not a native Google Sheet. The source workbook was read without modification.",
    "All six visible tabs are included. There are no hidden sheets, external workbook links, comments, hyperlinks, data validations, or charts.",
    "No filled client record is present. AMAYA KELSEA appears only as measured-by metadata on the existing approved house mannequin reference.",
    "00-MEASUREMENT SHEET MASTER G31:H33 contains three unlabeled source example pairs: 20/24.75, 25/37, 25/24.75. They have no assigned POM or stated unit, are not approved garment specifications, and must not populate new blank drafts automatically.",
    "The master I31:I33 source formula is sample actual H minus approved base G, returning blank when either input is blank. BW-AW-SPEC H/N formulas are target minus after wash, not after minus before wash.",
    "BODY REF-MANNEQUIN-SIZE 8-V1 I31:I33 literally subtract source G from H. G (DELTA) is blank in this source; H is HOUSE TARGET. These are retained as ambiguous source provenance and must not be silently relabeled or evaluated as target minus actual form.",
    "The BODY REF source pending-verification status and placeholder date/manufacturer/model values are historical provenance. The existing versioned approved SR-FORM-001 JSON drives the read-only reference viewer and its actual-form-minus-manufacturer comparison.",
    "All 20 BF POM codes, source labels, measuring methods, seven manufacturer values, thirteen null manufacturer values, and twenty actual-form values exactly match the approved repository JSON and methods JSON.",
    "The two embedded mannequin JPEGs exactly match the existing assets/house-sheet/mannequin-front.jpg and mannequin-back.jpg bytes. Reuse those original assets unchanged.",
    "No units, size names, grade increments, pass/fail rules, or garment ease are specified on the blank garment tabs. Preserve blanks; do not infer approved values from the mannequin reference.",
    "PATTERN CARD column E is bordered but unlabeled. No grainline/cut or other specific meaning is asserted for that column. LINING and TEMPLATES row groups follow explicit source labels.",
    "GRADED SPECS has eleven unnamed size slots F:P and no formulas. BW-AW-SPEC has 28 numbered rows plus four unnumbered specs-only rows; only additional rows 40 and 43 carry source difference formulas.",
    "The DELTA_1 defined name is unused and contains a literal LAMBDA expression with escaped sheet quotes. It is preserved as provenance; execution is not required by any source cell."
  ],
